{"slug":"q-n-tt","ar":"ق ن ط","total":6,"core":"despair","forms":[{"ar":"قَنَطُ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":4,"gloss":"to despair","word":null,"ex":{"s":15,"a":56,"p":3,"ar":["قَالَ","وَمَن","يَقْنَطُ","مِن","رَّحْمَةِ","رَبِّهِۦٓ","إِلَّا","ٱلضَّآلُّونَ"],"en":"He said, \"And who despairs of the mercy of his Lord except for those astray"}},{"ar":"قَٰنِطِين","kind":"active participle","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"despairing","word":null,"ex":{"s":15,"a":55,"p":7,"ar":["قَالُوا۟","بَشَّرْنَـٰكَ","بِٱلْحَقِّ","فَلَا","تَكُن","مِّنَ","ٱلْقَـٰنِطِينَ"],"en":"They said, \"We have given you good tidings in truth, so do not be of the despairing"}},{"ar":"قَنُوط","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"despairing","word":null,"ex":{"s":41,"a":49,"p":11,"ar":["لَّا","يَسْـَٔمُ","ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ","مِن","دُعَآءِ","ٱلْخَيْرِ","وَإِن","مَّسَّهُ","ٱلشَّرُّ","فَيَـُٔوسٌ","قَنُوطٌ"],"en":"Man is not weary of supplication for good [things], but if evil touches him, he is hopeless and despairing"}}],"surahs":[[15,2],[30,1],[39,1],[41,1],[42,1]]}